^["done"]{
 # ~#shipped: []
 # ~#resolved(label): "<question> — <answer>; evidence: <stream stamp | commit | path>"
 ~#resolved(entry_scope): "Line start anywhere, or line start inside a frame? — prefix position with no << open; line start is the lexer's proxy, and a frame is not required; evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:13, docs/theory/spw/line-items.spw"
 ~#resolved(inline_entries): "May an entry follow a frame's opening brace? — only with its own terminator: a body to the newline would take the closing brace, so an inline entry is a quoted one; evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:13, docs/theory/spw/line-items.spw"
 ~#resolved(old_quoted_entries): "Do older quoted entries stay as they are? — yes; a quoted body is the inline-capable form of an entry; evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:13, docs/theory/spw/line-items.spw"
 ~#resolved(ordinal_beats): "Are ordinal entries editable beats? — >>[n] is the shape of a log a run will write (saga templates); steps to perform are ..[n] and may be renumbered; dated entries stay append-only; evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:13, docs/theory/spw/line-items.spw"
 ~#resolved(body_reading): "Plain prose, or prose with refs? — a mixed phrase: >> bodies prose-first, .. bodies expression-first; inside prose a sigil at a word start with a name, bracket, brace or quote after it begins an expression; evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:13, docs/theory/spw/line-items.spw"
 ~#resolved(detect_vs_thread): "Does pathless parse still need the plan lens? — no; with entries read in every dialect every file counts the same errors with and without its path (H5); evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:34, 866826ff"
 ~#resolved(detect_rule): "What signature would content detection read? — none is needed, since detection is dropped; evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:34, 866826ff"
 ~#resolved(template_pragma): "Should new plans carry an at-dialect Spw.p pragma? — no; entries read in every dialect, and commit refs raise no errors without the plan lens; evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:34, 866826ff"
 ~#dropped(topography_path_option): "H5 holds: snapshotTopography gives the with-path verdict with no path; evidence: stream 2026-10-12 22:34, 866826ff"
